erlin 2026 打穿 Edge 沙箱和 Exchange，呼应他 2021 年 ProxyLogon 的旧账。但真正的新闻在场外：19 年来第一次 ZDI 报名超额关闭，被拒研究员把手里的 0day 直接公开发了。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FiatDdM4vSwruIzJpc3nzSMfOwEw5Ma1ZpT1Ohjy7j5dJcKSQHPtoA5QdYg65MH6AIwNbNOwJm29oS4pRybJfM17QjunoOUYXsWcObaM6yaZo%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-05-17T14:41:56.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg5NjAxNjc5OQ%3D%3D:2247484648:1","title":"《社会正义谬误》读书笔记","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5NjAxNjc5OQ==&mid=2247484648&idx=1&sn=f01a006d03f4037dc044c3a7c57868bc&chksm=c10bed505058763ede5d30b1e988f68052d2998a389054a8c4b9db67a3234555f044969ae2a6&scene=126&sessionid=1795732257#rd","description":"对富人加税，最后亏的为什么是穷人？最低工资法推行后，黑人青年失业率为什么反而翻倍？平权加分政策，为什么让被照顾的人更难毕业？Sowell 用半世纪的研究告诉我们：很多以正义为名的政策，只是善意装上了发动机，撞死了它本想救的人。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FiatDdM4vSwrvxQicDibGiagjP6YBYTfquKHyjZsib3b6EDtEbx5OY4XHdwPzsCXhARO0a514z3crX5IB7IkA78laP9s5qezhBZCWjw4HCsHtqyRA%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-05-10T11:07:28.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg5NjAxNjc5OQ%3D%3D:2247484644:1","title":"规模化 SAST & SCA 漏洞修复","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5NjAxNjc5OQ==&mid=2247484644&idx=1&sn=2de6211f598ae85287dd08baa0b12b8d&chksm=c1a1dd5a1d29ab8276af583d49224bcf14b41d84c2c833b75525d28b0c21b26450a2be1cb158&scene=126&sessionid=1795732257#rd","description":"高绩效 AppSec 团队修复率是普通团队3倍，差距不在工具在流程。PR阶段发现的漏洞比全量扫描快9倍修完，因为开发者上下文还在。Blocking\r\n  Rules、可达性过滤用得越深收益越大。漏洞超90天基本就烂在Backlog里了。Critical修复率低于50%，先查流程，别查工具。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FiatDdM4vSwrtTDNxusGN6XEQQicW7ucnyuiaYMrvwYJaJzZFv8x9C1IotV8SdfVW5KV0xLH5ic34RGEq3nbpcOzjia4eCbAuGEE9m8F4WTia7s5a8%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-04-12T14:49:21.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg5NjAxNjc5OQ%3D%3D:2247484631:1","title":"axios 被黑始末","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5NjAxNjc5OQ==&mid=2247484631&idx=1&sn=a80def7886ac0793e043e3c9c13ac48d&chksm=c1768348cf5744d88c2a10c24e811f9d0d31ad72e77bb8d4cad5ceac126b31482a8a552ca150&scene=126&sessionid=1795732257#rd","description":"axios 维护者 Jason 被攻击者伪装成公司创始人，通过假 Slack 工作区和 Teams 会议实施社工，以\"系统更新\"为由诱导安装 RAT，随后用盗取的凭证向 npm 推送恶意版本，注入远控木马。毒版本存活约三小时。幕后疑为朝鲜黑客组织\r\n BlueNoroff。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FiatDdM4vSwruVZ9wF4csrQep8CoKYEc96TfsnLicB3QZqQ14lIlJERAIQIvbbPFHnu6HibpEz2tjwcYh7cxlFJw9q0gpAu8tM2zZxXqrn0G9Pk%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-04-04T14:38:31.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg5NjAxNjc5OQ%3D%3D:2247484622:1","title":"利用大语言模型优化 CodeQL 漏洞挖掘","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5NjAxNjc5OQ==&mid=2247484622&idx=1&sn=ff55a9a5b177d2e872df3a11e43de02f&chksm=c1df79f1e4f9b422013b4a7a7c64267b97a7af3142a762d143b044c7c2994105e03f4f7f0b5c&scene=126&sessionid=1795732257#rd","description":"针对CodeQL海量误报痛点，利用按需上下文提取与引导式提问技术，引入LLM进行精准二审。该方案将误报率降低超90%，仅以极低成本在Linux Kernel等项目中挖掘出8个高危CVE。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2F6USuqjXjYk51qyJu4W7nZWTiax4BoJmDP7GJewWWyXyIgzrT7NkicicslzqT7O0WgH1KjXPcb53dYfn87v5yAAv5g%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2025-12-12T13:09:56.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg5NjAxNjc5OQ%3D%3D:2247484592:1","title":"VS Code Copilot 提示词注入漏洞分析","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5NjAxNjc5OQ==&mid=2247484592&idx=1&sn=83d8bd964224df21f163a4f056a801d5&chksm=c16a77b7ed129e6eefc6f59f5b530b21e30cdfe5e07d4e0099d6b4bdeac4186e2022ab12fac8&scene=126&sessionid=1795732257#rd","description":"译者按：本文基于 GitHub 安全实验室安全研究员 Michael Stepankin 的最新发现，揭示了","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2F6USuqjXjYk7alz4HgPemvOKcX8hibiaORss4Um0mzIQSicyz6zVSZL2pumB6nBScewZpcGbCB5BZhBELrBMUzrErg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":